        "pageNumber": 2,
        "runningHead": "BFU VS AFU STATES",
        "content": "<div class=\"legal-dispatch-header\">\n      <span class=\"badge-primary\">Cryptographic Device States</span>\n      <h2>BFU vs AFU: Encryption Key States in Memory</h2>\n    </div>\n    <p>Modern mobile operating systems (iOS and Android) operate under two radically different cryptographic states:</p>\n\n    <table class=\"statutory-table\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr><th>Feature</th><th>Before First Unlock (BFU)</th><th>After First Unlock (AFU)</th></tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td><strong>Device State</strong></td><td>Powered on, but user has never entered passcode since boot.</td><td>Passcode entered at least once since boot; device currently locked or unlocked.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><strong>Key Availability</strong></td><td>Only Device-Encrypted (DE) keys are accessible. User-data encryption keys are strictly locked.</td><td>Credential-Encrypted (CE) master keys reside in volatile RAM / hardware registers.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><strong>Extraction Yield</strong></td><td>Extremely limited (basic OS files, incoming call notifications, Wi-Fi configurations).</td><td>Full File System extraction possible; messaging databases, photos, and app caches accessible.</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <div class=\"exam-trap-box\">\n      <strong>Exam Rule on Mobile Seizure:</strong> Seized phones must be placed in a <strong>Faraday bag</strong> with a <strong>power bank</strong> connected. Battery death drops the device into <strong>BFU</strong> (Before First Unlock), locking master keys. <strong>Airplane mode</strong> alone does NOT guarantee isolation!\n    </div>\n\n    \n        <div class=\"spread-quiz-cta-banner\">\n          <div class=\"spread-quiz-cta-info\">\n            <span style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin-right: 8px;\">🎯</span>\n            <div>\n              <strong style=\"font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--text-heading);\">Test Your Mastery: Spread 1</strong>\n              <div style=\"font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--text-muted);\">Practice all 10 targeted exam questions (Q1–Q10) on Mobile Seizure, Faraday Bags & BFU vs AFU.</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"btn-tool btn-mcq\" onclick=\"window.openMCQForSpread(0)\" style=\"font-size: 0.8rem; padding: 6px 14px;\">Start Quiz (Q1–Q10) →</button>\n        </div>"
