        "runningHead": "KEYCHAIN & ROUTINED GPS",
        "content": "<div class=\"legal-dispatch-header\">\n      <span class=\"badge-primary\">Keychain & Location Artifacts</span>\n      <h2>iOS Keychain Classes & routined Location Caches</h2>\n    </div>\n    <h3>The iOS Keychain (keychain-2.db)</h3>\n    <p>The <strong>iOS Keychain</strong> is a centralized SQLite database (<code>/private/var/Keychains/keychain-2.db</code>) that securely stores Wi-Fi passwords, email account tokens, credit card data, and app secrets. Keychain items are governed by accessibility attributes like <code>kSecAttrAccessibleAfterFirstUnlock</code> (accessible in AFU state) and <code>kSecAttrAccessibleWhenUnlocked</code>.</p>\n\n    <h3>Location Tracking & iTunes Backups</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>routined / Significant Locations:</strong> Located in <code>/private/var/mobile/Library/Caches/com.apple.routined/</code>; caches frequented places, visit timestamps, and GPS coordinates.</li>\n      <li><strong>iTunes Backup Architecture:</strong> Backups produce flat directories where files are renamed to the 40-character <strong>SHA-1 hash</strong> of their relative domain path, indexed by <strong>Manifest.db</strong>.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"exam-trap-box\">\n      <strong>Exam Rule on iOS Artifacts:</strong> <code>sms.db</code> uses <strong>nanoseconds since January 1, 2001 UTC</strong>. Call records reside in <code>CallHistory.storedata</code>. Passwords reside in <code>keychain-2.db</code>. iTunes backups index hashed files via <code>Manifest.db</code>.\n    </div>\n\n    \n        <div class=\"spread-quiz-cta-banner\">\n          <div class=\"spread-quiz-cta-info\">\n            <span style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin-right: 8px;\">🎯</span>\n            <div>\n              <strong style=\"font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--text-heading);\">Test Your Mastery: Spread 6</strong>\n              <div style=\"font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--text-muted);\">Practice all 10 targeted exam questions (Q51–Q60) on iOS Artifacts: SMS, Calls & Keychains.</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"btn-tool btn-mcq\" onclick=\"window.openMCQForSpread(5)\" style=\"font-size: 0.8rem; padding: 6px 14px;\">Start Quiz (Q51–Q60) →</button>\n        </div>"
